### Create a New Exhibition
POST {{baseUrl}}/createExhibition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Modern Art & Tech Exhibition 2026",
  "description": "An immersive digital art exhibition showcasing emerging creators",
  "imageUrl": "frontend/src/assets/images/exhibitions/monalisa.png",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15T09:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-17T17:00:00.000Z",
  "status": "current",
  "room": "Room A",
  "tags": ["art"],
  "highlight": true
}

### Create a New Exhibition
POST {{baseUrl}}/createExhibition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tech Exhibition 2027",
  "description": "An immersive digital art exhibition showcasing emerging creators",
  "image": "https://example.com",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15T09:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-17T17:00:00.000Z",
  "status": "upcoming",
  "room": "Room B",
  "tags": ["people"],
  "highlight": true
}

###

### Get All Exhibitions (Requires Protected Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/getAllExhibition
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Exhibition by ID (Requires Protected Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/6aa947a8f81122448d1ae62a
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Delete an Exhibition (Requires Admin Route)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/6aa947a8f81122448d1ae62a
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
